      "js.match.note_series": "Step 1 slides along a <b>constant-resistance</b> circle, because a series part can only change X. Step 2 slides along a <b>constant-conductance</b> circle of the blue admittance grid, because a parallel part can only change B. Two moves, and you are in the centre.",
